            "sent_at": "2026-09-23T08:40:00Z",
            "mentions": ["U01MIRA"],
            "text": "Bad news from Fogbell (see Bertram's mail): the RX-40 receivers read JSON only, and CBOR is not on their plan before next year. All our shore stations run RX-40. @Mira, proposal: drop CBOR, stay on JSON and gzip the packets. Firmware 4.2 inflates gzip, and a packet comes to about 190 bytes.",
            "url": "https://chat.saltreed.example.test/archives/C0BEACON01/p1790152800000100"
          },
          {
            "id": "1790153700.000100",
            "author": "U07RAFE",
            "sent_at": "2026-09-23T08:55:00Z",
            "text": "The dashboard already reads JSON, so that's less work for me.",
            "url": "https://chat.saltreed.example.test/archives/C0BEACON01/p1790153700000100"
          },
          {
            "id": "1790154720.000100",
            "author": "U01MIRA",
            "sent_at": "2026-09-23T09:12:00Z",
            "text": "Agreed. We drop CBOR: Beacon v2.3 sends gzip-compressed JSON packets. Lev, please update the packet format doc again.",
            "url": "https://chat.saltreed.example.test/archives/C0BEACON01/p1790154720000100"
          },
